        <mxCell id="sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#9aa0b4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="cloudlab.py applies each selected cloud&#x27;s cluster/ stage, verifies the cluster&#x27;s TLS endpoint, then applies its deployment/ stage; each stage keeps its own local state and receives the injected ownership, cloud and cluster_stage variables. A maintainer applies workers-identity once per account. Pods reach the control plane through one of the endpoint options." vertex="1">
